    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33572" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pampĭnātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		pampinus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>having tendrils and leaves.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: lanceam argenteam pampinatam librarum
			triginta, Gallien. Ep. ap. Treb. <i><span class="en">Claud. 17,
			5</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>tendril-shaped</i>, <i>tendril-like</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 16,
				42, 82, § 225</span></i>.</div>
